 "remarks": "Fully remodeled, top-floor loft-style condominium in the heart of downtown Stamford. Soaring vaulted ceilings, abundant natural light, and an open-concept layout create a bright, spacious main living area. The second-floor loft features two separate rooms, currently configured as a home office and an additional bedroom, offering flexibility for working from home or hosting guests. The updated kitchen opens directly to the living and dining areas and features quartz countertops, stainless steel appliances, and a large island with seating. Both bathrooms have been tastefully renovated, complemented by new flooring throughout the main living areas and new carpeting in the bedrooms and loft. Enjoy a private balcony overlooking the professionally landscaped courtyard, in-unit laundry, and secure underground garage parking at no additional cost. This full-service building offers a full-time, on-site concierge and a fitness center, just minutes from Metro-North, restaurants, shopping, and entertainment. A versatile option for a primary residence or investment property, combining remodeled interiors, flexible loft space, and downtown convenience.",
